1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,880
 As we seek the Savior's perspective, he will often guide us to those who need to be seen.

2
00:00:07,840 --> 00:00:13,360
 Years ago, I prayed to know how I could help a co-worker who seemed isolated.

3
00:00:14,380 --> 00:00:19,080
 As I acted on simple promptings to include him, our friendship grew.

4
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:27,220
 I learned that when we ask Heavenly Father to help us see others, he guides us to those who feel unseen.

5
00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:31,500
 You too can make a difference in someone's life.

